cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "easypaper: Scaffold a Reproducible Quarto Manuscript Project"
abstract: >-
  Creates, in one call, the directory structure of a reproducible scientific
  manuscript written in Quarto: sections as separate files, a single entry
  point, journal styles, independent bibliographies for the supplementary
  material, and a submission folder holding the blinded manuscript together
  with a data and code compendium ready for a data repository.
authors:
  - family-names: "Sanchez-Garcia"
    given-names: "Daniel"
    email: "danielsangarci@gmail.com"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/danielsangarci/easypaper"
url: "https://github.com/danielsangarci/easypaper"
keywords:
  - reproducible-research
  - quarto
  - manuscript
  - r
